══ TASK 3: UNSAFE CODE COMPLETE INVENTORY ══════════════════════════════════

  3.1 — Find EVERY occurrence of the word "unsafe" in all in-scope .rs files
  3.2 — For each unsafe occurrence list:
        | File | Line | Type | Code Snippet | Safety Invariant Documented? |
        | Initial Risk: High/Med/Low |
        Types: unsafe block | unsafe fn | unsafe impl | unsafe trait
  3.3 — For each HIGH risk unsafe:
